      "id": "claim_4506424fb3ae4dc7b6c7c08d4ae1ac4b",
      "statement": "Worker identity in the pool is `settings.worker_id.strip() or socket.gethostname()`: `WORKER_ID` when set and non-blank, otherwise the container hostname, and that value is what lands in `claimed_by` and in the `workers` table.",
