      "statement": "`note_worker(worker_id)` upserts `workers.last_seen_at` and is called once in `WorkerLoop.start()` and at the top of every `_runner` poll iteration; `GET /health` exposes the result as `pool: store.stats()`, which counts workers seen within `worker_ttl_seconds=120`, so the counter reflects recently polling workers rather than workers currently busy inside a generation.",
