    {
      "id": "claim_96c365d3ebcc46a98125f81314028a35",
      "statement": "`WorkerLoop.start()` spawns `max(1, settings.max_concurrent_jobs)` identical `_runner` asyncio tasks named `openwiki-worker-<worker_id>-<index>`; the index is only used for naming, so `MAX_CONCURRENT_JOBS` is the number of concurrent generations per container.",
