    {
      "id": "claim_5e41f2e280e741f4bf0aea1e69a91d5e",
      "statement": "When `OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_EXTRA_HEADERS` is configured together with `OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_BASE_URL`, the worker starts a loopback header-injecting proxy in `start()` and sets `env_overrides = {\"OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_BASE_URL\": proxy.base_url}`; that dict is threaded through `run_pipeline` and `run_openwiki`/`build_env` into the CLI subprocess, and the proxy is stopped by `WorkerLoop.stop()`.",
      "evidence": [
