    {
      "id": "claim_3a382d6c769f419cb187d7d25dfab632",
      "statement": "`WorkerLoop._run` mints the per-wiki logger from `store.logs_path(wiki_id)` with the source token as a secret, logs `claimed by worker <worker_id>`, creates a fresh `asyncio.Event` and the `_track` task, awaits `pipeline.run_pipeline` with the worker's `env_overrides`, and writes the returned `pages`/`size_bytes`/`push_result` through `store.complete(..., status=\"done\")`.",
