        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5b41cdf3fa5e42819cd146ac3edb08af",
      "statement": "The worker pool is exercised through the production loop in tests: `tests/conftest.py` sets `run_local_worker=True` with sub-second `worker_poll_seconds`/`worker_progress_seconds` and points `OPENWIKI_BIN` at `tests/fixtures/fake_openwiki.py`, `test_health.py` asserts `pool[\"workers\"] == 1`, and `test_api_wikis.py::test_active_wikis_are_resumed_after_a_restart` forces a running row with a dead claim (`claimed_by=\"crashed-worker\"`, `claim_id=\"deadbeef\"`, `last_seen_at=None`) and expects the reaper to requeue and finish it.",
      "evidence": [
