    {
      "id": "claim_2520f78f46774168b8b8bbd551b6cfb2",
      "statement": "The heartbeat contract consumed by `_track` is pinned by `tests/test_worker_queue.py`, which asserts the heartbeat result shape (`{\"ok\": True, \"cancel\": False, \"status\": ...}`), cooperative cancel via `cancel_requested`, and that `complete` with a stale `claim_id` returns `False` without changing the row.",
